{
  "name": "dsh-agnes-create",
  "version": "0.11.1",
  "description": "Agnes 创作：在 DeepSeek Harness 里出图、出视频，也能让 agent 在对话里直接调用。图片支持文生图 / 图生图 / 多图合成（agnes-image-2.5-flash）；视频支持文生 / 首尾帧关键帧 / 参考图三种模式与 seed（agnes-video-2.5-flash，720P，4–12 秒）。侧边栏面板 + 模型工具双通道，视频任务由宿主推进、刷新或重启可接回；提示词写进图片（PNG iTXt / JPEG COM）悬停可看可复制；可浏览输出目录、历史 24 条、模型可切换并测试连接；标题栏的模型名可直接点开切换；提示词可存成自定义预设并一键扩写。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/zxygithub/dsh-agnes-create.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/zxygithub/dsh-agnes-create#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/zxygithub/dsh-agnes-create/issues"
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "registry": "https://registry.npmjs.org/",
    "access": "public"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "agnes",
    "image-generation",
    "video-generation",
    "image-to-image",
    "img2img",
    "multi-image",
    "text-to-video",
    "image-to-video",
    "keyframe",
    "seed"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.2.2-rc.1"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-renderer"
      ]
    },
    "compatibility": {
      "dshReleases": {
        "0.2.2-rc.1+": "compatible"
      }
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "react": "^18.0.0 || ^19.0.0",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-renderer": ">=0.2.2-rc.1"
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
